{"product_id":"essential-gcse-ict-for-wjec-students-book","title":"Essential GCSE ICT for WJEC: Student's Book","description":"\u003cp\u003eOfficially endorsed by WJEC, this title covers the 2010 GCSE ICT for WJEC specification, giving students all they need to achieve their potential during the course. Designed to help students transfer their understanding of the subject into improved exam performance. Information presented on colourful, highly illustrated double-page spreads to engage students. Up-to-date, dynamic case studies to help students link theory with practice. Integrated assessment support designed to help boost grades. Plenty of exam-style questions and test-yourself activities to prepare students for exams. Clearly defined key terminology, with summary mind maps for each topic. Extension activities to boost higher understanding and application for more able students. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:211 x 277  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Stephen Doyle \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781850085416 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 320\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43401995616409,"sku":"4EDU9781850085416","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/eeb3ea111fb9f3f0f8b5b1c804fb016b.jpg?v=1695454348","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/essential-gcse-ict-for-wjec-students-book","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}